agos está completa (3.147204ms)\n✔ los importes se muestran siempre con dos decimales (1.503666ms)\nℹ tests 7\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 7\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 809.88357\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"npm test 2>&1\", \"workdir\": \"/home/labseg/h/b-agents-md-opencode-frontera-base-r2/app\"}"},"time":{"start":1795479997329,"end":1795479999115}}}}
